<title>UKRAINE: Ukraine T-bill yields fall at auction.</title>
<headline>Ukraine T-bill yields fall at auction.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Average yields at auctions of six-month, nine-month and 12-month Ukraine discount Treasury bills on Monday all fell but the finance ministry did not accept any bids for three-month paper, the National Bank said.</p>
<p>Results of six-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p> Auction Number	   212			208</p>
<p> Issue date		 May 5, 1997	    April 29, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date	    November 5, 1997     October 29, 1997</p>
<p> Denominations	    100 hryvnia	    100 hryvnia</p>
<p> Issue volume		9.00 million hryvnia    no limit stated</p>
<p> Amount sold		 9.00 million hryvnia    14.72 million hryvnia</p>
<p> Proceeds		    7.87 million hryvnia    12.80 million hryvnia</p>
<p> Average yield	    28.70 pct		29.99 pct</p>
<p> Average price	    87.48 pct		86.99 pct</p>
<p> Lowest accepted price  87.37 pct		86.51 pct</p>
<p>Results of nine-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p> Auction Number	   213			209</p>
<p> Issue date		 May 5, 1997	    April 29, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date	    February 4, 1998     January 28, 1998</p>
<p> Denominations	    100 hryvnia	    100 hryvnia</p>
<p> Issue volume	     24.00 million hryvnia    no limit stated</p>
<p> Amount sold		24.00 million hryvnia    45.49 million hryvnia</p>
<p> Proceeds		   19.47 million hryvnia    36.48 million hryvnia</p>
<p> Average yield	    31.12 pct		33.01 pct</p>
<p> Average price	    81.12 pct		80.20 pct</p>
<p> Lowest accepted price  80.99 pcct	     79.37 pct</p>
<p>Results of 12-month T-bill auction:</p>
<p> Auction Number	   214			210</p>
<p> Issue Date		 May 5, 1997	    April 29, 1997</p>
<p> Maturity date	    May 6, 1998	    April 29, 1998</p>
<p> Denominations	    100 hryvnia	    100 hryvnia</p>
<p> Issue volume	     30.00 million hryvnia    no limit stated</p>
<p> Amount sold		30.00 million hryvnia    104.34 million hryvnia</p>
<p> Actual amount raised   22.16 million hryvnia    75.22 million hryvnia</p>
<p> Average yield	    35.51 pct		38.82 pct</p>
<p> Average price	    73.85 pct		72.09 pct</p>
<p> Lowest accepted price  73.85 pct		71.57 hryvnia</p>
<p>Bids for three-month paper ranged from 94.32 to 94.35 percent. At the last auction of three-month bills on April 29 the average yield was 24.02 percent on a price of 94.35 percent.</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 244 9150</p>
</text>
